{
 "name": "tour",
 "category": "tour",
 "source": "TSPLIB95 (G. Reinelt), symmetric travelling salesman problems, as hosted by the author's group at comopt.ifi.uni-heidelberg.de/software/TSPLIB95/tsp/ : the source's list of optimal tour lengths (TSP-BEST.html, the page formerly at STSP.html), the instance file <name>.tsp.gz of each of the 43 instances on that list whose name gives at most 173 cities, and the optimal tour <name>.opt.tour.gz where the source serves one (it publishes tours for a part of the instances only: the others are marked missing). Fetched over https from that host (its http address, named in older references, did not answer); the documentation of the distance functions is tsp95.pdf in the same directory",
 "terms": "no licence text on the source's pages; the library is published by its author as test data for research. Fetched by hash, not redistributed here.",
 "reference": "the optimal tour length the source lists for each instance in TSP-BEST.html ('all problems are now solved to optimality'), read by the kernel only; where the source publishes an optimal tour, it attains that length",
